/*
From OutPut: 
	The quality of sales and price is wrong | bad
    The calculation is not working
Solution: 
	We have to talk to an expert from the business or the source system
	Showing this Scenario to them & Discuss
	Usually we will get two answers:
		- Data issues will be fixed direct in source system
		  Bad data will be presented in the WareHouse untill the source system clean it 
		- Data issues has to be fixed in DataWarehouse!!
		  Ask the expert to support in improving these issues according to the business rules
Rules:
	If Sales is negative, zero, or NULL Derive it using Quantity and Price!
	If Price is zero, or NULL Derive it using Sales and Quantity!
	If Price is negative, Convert it to a positive value! */

SELECT DISTINCT
	 sls_sales AS old_sls_sales ,
	 sls_quantity,
	 sls_price AS old_sls_price,
	 CASE WHEN sls_sales IS NULL OR sls_sales <= 0 OR sls_sales != sls_quantity * ABS(sls_price)
